TI  - CL-GIE v4.0: Blockchain-Anchored Cross-Layer Genomic Integrity With Hierarchical Bloomβ€“Merkle Trees for Ethics-Aware, Explainable Personalized Gene Editing
PY  - 2026
T2  - IEEE Access
VL  - 14
SP  - 17702
EP  - 17723
