TI  - Blockchain-Enhanced Construction Records: Transforming Evidentiary Standards and Dispute Resolution in International Arbitration
PY  - 2026
T2  - Journal of Legal Affairs and Dispute Resolution in Engineering and Construction
VL  - 18
IS  - 2
C7  - 04526011
