AB  - This research introduces an AI-powered network forensic system that combines Convolutional Neural Networks (CNN), Elliptic Curve Digital Signature Algorithm (ECDSA), and Blockchain to enhance digital forensic investigations' accuracy, authenticity, and security. The CNN model, optimized with SMOTE and trained on the UNSW-NB15 dataset, identifies cyber threats in real time. ECDSA ensures cryptographic evidence integrity, while Blockchain provides tamper-proof storage with a verifiable chain of custody. Experimental findings indicate 97.5% accuracy in detection and 100 % integrity in blockchain, far superior to conventional forensic methods. The system presented provides an efficient, scalable, and secure framework for managing digital evidence in cybercrime investigations.  Β© 2025 IEEE.
