AB  - This paper proposes an innovative framework integrating artificial intelligence and cryptographic technologies to address security challenges in sensitive video data management. The system features three key innovations: 1) A lightweight YOLOv7-Edge model; 2) A context-aware multi-layer encryption strategy combining SM4 and attribute-based encryption; 3) A blockchain-based decentralized audit mechanism with adaptive Practical Byzantine Fault Toleranceconsensus. Validated on 100,000+ surveillance videos from China's "Safe City"initiative, the framework demonstrates 97.3% privacy protection efficiency with 95ms latency, reducing storage overhead by 68% through tensor-based compression. Β© 2025 SPIE.
