TI  - Enhancement of Cybersecurity with Blockchain-Based Identity Authentication Systems: Zero-information Evidence Procedures for Secure Access, Biometric Encryption, and Decentralized Trust
PY  - 2025
T2  - 2025 IEEE 7th International Conference on Computing, Communication and Automation, ICCCA 2025
DO  - 10.1109/ICCCA66364.2025.11325592
