TI  - TEXT2CHAIN: A MODULAR NLP-ENHANCED ORACLE ARCHITECTURE WITH DECENTRALIZED VALIDATION AND HUMAN-IN-THE-LOOP FOR SECURE OFF-CHAIN/ONCHAIN INTEGRATION
PY  - 2025
