AB  - Voting is a decentralized system where people and administrators face challenges with security, accessibility, transparency, and trust. To overcome these limitations, our project describes an enhanced democratic voting system which uses blockchain technology and state-of-the-art biometric verification. This system ensures a transparent, auditable, and tamper-proof election process with multiple security methods such as facial recognition, voter ID validation, fingerprint verification, and Aadhaar verification. The voting process is done by casting votes after analyzing live face detection and fingerprint verification with their voter details and Aadhaar details. After casting, an individual's vote is converted to cryptographic form and then stored to ensure traceability and resistance to manipulation. Β© 2025 IEEE.
