TI  - Incentives against power grabs or how to engineer the revolution in a pooled proof of stake system
PY  - 2021
T2  - Proceedings - 3rd IEEE International Conference on Decentralized Applications and Infrastructures, DAPPS 2021
SP  - 1
EP  - 10
DO  - 10.1109/DAPPS52256.2021.00006
